From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Cl=C3=A9ment=20Knoderer?= <clement.knoderer@icloud.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 23:49:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Refine French translations, improve wording across languages
 and adjust text layouts (#1636)

* Improve French translations and clarify interface labels

* Remove redundant localization entries

* Restore root search terminology in English

* Keep main's English for selected labels

Revert the English wording of the input source, appearance, display,
search scope, permission, Hyper Key, snippet, custom command, uninstall
and window layout labels to main. Restored strings keep their eight
translations, and the French for most of them follows this PR.

Make the Permissions pane subtitles all start with "Allows".

---------

Co-authored-by: Abue Ammar <iabueammar@gmail.com>
